<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"item":{"@type":"Thing","@id":"https:\/\/www.milligazete.com.tr","name":"Haberler"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"item":{"@type":"Thing","@id":"https:\/\/www.milligazete.com.tr\/gundem","name":"G\u00fcndem"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"item":{"@type":"Thing","@id":"https:\/\/www.milligazete.com.tr\/arikan-erbakan-ile-bir-araya-geldi-arikan-turkiyenin-onunu-acmak-istiyoruz-erbakan-milletimize-umut-olacak-calismalar-yapacagiz","name":"Ar\u0131kan, Erbakan ile bir araya geldi... Ar\u0131kan: \"T\u00fcrkiye'nin \u00f6n\u00fcn\u00fc a\u00e7mak istiyoruz\" Erbakan: \"Milletimize umut olacak \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar yapaca\u011f\u0131z\""}}]}</script>
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"NewsArticle","headline":"Ar\u0131kan, Erbakan ile bir araya geldi... Ar\u0131kan: \"T\u00fcrkiye'nin \u00f6n\u00fcn\u00fc a\u00e7mak istiyoruz\" Erbakan: \"Milletimize umut olacak \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar yapaca\u011f\u0131z\"","articleSection":"G\u00fcndem","dateCreated":"2026-08-11T19:57:00+03:00","datePublished":"2026-08-11T19:57:00+03:00","dateModified":"2026-08-11T20:01:47+03:00","wordCount":849,"genre":"news","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https:\/\/www.milligazete.com.tr\/arikan-erbakan-ile-bir-araya-geldi-arikan-turkiyenin-onunu-acmak-istiyoruz-erbakan-milletimize-umut-olacak-calismalar-yapacagiz"},"articleBody":"Saadet Partisi Genel Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Mahmut Ar\u0131kan, Yeniden Refah Partisi (YRP) Genel Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Fatih Erbakan\u2019\u0131 Saadet Partisi Genel Merkezi\u2019nde kabul etti.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nT\u00fcrkiye\u2019deki siyasi geli\u015fmelerin ve toplumun kar\u015f\u0131 kar\u015f\u0131ya bulundu\u011fu sorunlar\u0131n de\u011ferlendirildi\u011fi g\u00f6r\u00fc\u015fmede, iki partinin \u00f6n\u00fcm\u00fczdeki d\u00f6nemde ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirebilece\u011fi ortak \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar da ele al\u0131nd\u0131.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nG\u00f6r\u00fc\u015fmenin ard\u0131ndan iki lider, a\u00e7\u0131klamalarda bulundu.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nARIKAN: \u201cS\u0130YASET\u0130 SIKI\u015eMI\u015eLIKTAN \u00c7IKARACA\u011eIZ\u201d\r\n\r\nSaadet Partisi Genel Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Mahmut Ar\u0131kan, yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131klamada, \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131n\u0131n yaln\u0131zca iki partinin mevcut oylar\u0131n\u0131 korumas\u0131na veya art\u0131rmas\u0131na y\u00f6nelik olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 vurgulad\u0131.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAr\u0131kan, \u201cBizim \u015fu an g\u00f6r\u00fc\u015ft\u00fc\u011f\u00fcm\u00fcz hususlar mevcut oylar\u0131m\u0131z\u0131 muhafaza etmek veya mevcut oylar\u0131m\u0131z\u0131 bir miktar art\u0131rmak de\u011fil, T\u00fcrkiye\u2019de s\u0131k\u0131\u015fan siyaseti a\u00e7acak, yeniden b\u00fcy\u00fck T\u00fcrkiye\u2019nin hayata ge\u00e7irilmesine imza atacak birliktelikleri in\u015fa etmek istiyoruz\u201d dedi.\r\n\r\nT\u00fcrkiye\u2019de siyasetin \u00f6nemli \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcde s\u0131k\u0131\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 belirten Ar\u0131kan, hedeflerinin bu s\u0131k\u0131\u015fm\u0131\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131 a\u015farak karars\u0131z se\u00e7mene alternatif sunmak oldu\u011funu s\u00f6yledi.\r\n\r\n\u201cBU B\u0130RL\u0130KTEL\u0130\u011eE KATILACAK PART\u0130LER MUTLAKA OLACAKTIR\u201d\r\n\r\n\u00d6n\u00fcm\u00fczdeki d\u00f6nemde farkl\u0131 siyasi partiler ve isimlerle de birlikte \u00e7al\u0131\u015fma ihtimaline i\u015faret eden Ar\u0131kan, y\u00fcr\u00fct\u00fclen s\u00fcrecin iki partiyle s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131 olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 ifade etti.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAr\u0131kan, \u201cElbette bu birlikteli\u011fimize kat\u0131lacak partiler, yeni isimler mutlaka olacakt\u0131r. Say\u0131n Babacan da di\u011fer siyasiler de \u00f6n\u00fcm\u00fczdeki d\u00f6nemde beraber y\u00fcr\u00fcmek istedi\u011fimiz liderler, siyasi partiler olacak\u201d diye konu\u015ftu.\r\n\r\nAr\u0131kan, s\u00f6z konusu \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131n temel hedefinin \u201cs\u0131k\u0131\u015fan siyaseti a\u00e7mak, karars\u0131z diye tabir edilen se\u00e7mene adres olmak ve yeniden b\u00fcy\u00fck T\u00fcrkiye\u2019nin in\u015fas\u0131n\u0131 temin etmek\u201d oldu\u011funu kaydetti.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFAT\u0130H ERBAKAN: \u201cORTAK ADIMLARI KONU\u015eTUK\u201d\r\n\r\nYRP Genel Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Fatih Erbakan da g\u00f6r\u00fc\u015fmede iki partinin \u00f6n\u00fcm\u00fczdeki d\u00f6nemde birlikte atabilece\u011fi ad\u0131mlar\u0131n ele al\u0131nd\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 s\u00f6yledi. Erbakan, \u201cYeniden Refah Partisi ve Saadet Partisi\u2019nin \u00f6n\u00fcm\u00fczdeki d\u00f6nemde nas\u0131l birlikte ortak birtak\u0131m ad\u0131mlar atabilece\u011fine ili\u015fkin m\u00fczakerelerimizi yapt\u0131k\u201d dedi.\r\n\r\nT\u00fcrkiye\u2019nin \u00f6n\u00fcn\u00fc a\u00e7acak ve millete umut olacak bir siyasi \u00e7al\u0131\u015fma y\u00fcr\u00fctmenin \u00f6nemine dikkat \u00e7eken Erbakan, Milli G\u00f6r\u00fc\u015f\u2019\u00fcn Meclis\u2019te daha g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc temsil edilmesi i\u00e7in yap\u0131labilecek \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar konusunda fikir al\u0131\u015fveri\u015finde bulunduklar\u0131n\u0131 belirtti.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nM\u0130LL\u0130 G\u00d6R\u00dc\u015e\u2019TE ORTAK HAREKET VURGUSU\r\n\r\nErbakan, iki partinin ekonomi, sosyal politikalar, d\u0131\u015f politika ve toplumun temel meseleleri konusunda benzer hassasiyetlere sahip oldu\u011funu ifade ederek, Milli G\u00f6r\u00fc\u015f \u00e7izgisindeki partilerin birlikte hareket etmesinin \u00f6nemine dikkat \u00e7ekti.\r\n\r\n\u201cT\u00fcrkiye\u2019nin \u00f6n\u00fcn\u00fc a\u00e7acak, milletimize umut olacak, Milli G\u00f6r\u00fc\u015f\u2019\u00fcn Meclis\u2019te daha g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc temsil edilmesi ve in\u015fallah Milli G\u00f6r\u00fc\u015f\u2019\u00fcn iktidar\u0131na yol a\u00e7acak bir \u00e7al\u0131\u015fman\u0131n nas\u0131l yap\u0131labilece\u011fine ili\u015fkin fikir al\u0131\u015fveri\u015fi ve isti\u015farelerde bulunduk\u201d diyen Erbakan, \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131n bu do\u011frultuda s\u00fcrd\u00fcr\u00fclece\u011fini s\u00f6yledi.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nMECL\u0130S\u2019TE G\u00dc\u00c7L\u00dc TEMS\u0130L HEDEF\u0130\r\n\r\nG\u00f6r\u00fc\u015fmenin \u00f6nemli ba\u015fl\u0131klar\u0131ndan biri de se\u00e7im \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131 oldu. Erbakan, iki partinin Meclis\u2019te daha g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc temsil edilmesini sa\u011flayacak bir \u00e7al\u0131\u015fma \u00fczerinde durduklar\u0131n\u0131 belirterek, milletvekili se\u00e7imlerine y\u00f6nelik ittifak se\u00e7ene\u011fi konusunda g\u00f6r\u00fc\u015fmeler yapt\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131klad\u0131.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nErbakan, \u201c\u015eu an i\u00e7in milletvekili se\u00e7imine y\u00f6nelik bir ittifak\u0131n yap\u0131lmas\u0131yla ilgili g\u00f6r\u00fc\u015fmeler yap\u0131yoruz. \u015eu ana kadar ortak cumhurba\u015fkan\u0131 aday\u0131 \u00fczerinde herhangi bir g\u00f6r\u00fc\u015fmemiz, m\u00fczakeremiz olmad\u0131\u201d ifadelerini kulland\u0131.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\"EL\u0130M\u0130Z\u0130 TA\u015eIN ALTINA KOYMAYA HAZIRIZ\"\r\n\r\nErbakan, cumhurba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 adayl\u0131\u011f\u0131 konusunda \u015fu ana kadar herhangi bir g\u00f6r\u00fc\u015fme yap\u0131lmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 belirtirken, \u00f6n\u00fcm\u00fczdeki s\u00fcre\u00e7te m\u00fczakerelerin devam etmesi halinde bu konunun da g\u00fcndeme gelebilece\u011fini s\u00f6yledi.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHer iki partinin de T\u00fcrkiye siyasetindeki s\u0131k\u0131\u015fm\u0131\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131 a\u015fmak i\u00e7in fedak\u00e2rl\u0131k yapmaya haz\u0131r oldu\u011funu belirten Erbakan, \u201cElimizi ta\u015f\u0131n alt\u0131na koymaya haz\u0131r\u0131z\u201d mesaj\u0131 verdi.\r\n\r\nHEDEF: S\u0130YASETTEK\u0130 SIKI\u015eMI\u015eLI\u011eI A\u015eMAK\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAr\u0131kan ise T\u00fcrkiye\u2019de yaln\u0131zca siyasi de\u011fil, ayn\u0131 zamanda ekonomik ve toplumsal g\u00fcven sorunlar\u0131n\u0131n da bulundu\u011funu ifade etti. T\u00fcrkiye\u2019de geni\u015f bir kesimin mevcut siyasi tablo kar\u015f\u0131s\u0131nda alternatif aray\u0131\u015f\u0131nda oldu\u011funu belirten Ar\u0131kan, Saadet Partisi ile Yeniden Refah Partisi aras\u0131ndaki g\u00f6r\u00fc\u015fmelerin yaln\u0131zca iki partinin siyasi kazan\u0131m\u0131na y\u00f6nelik olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 vurgulad\u0131.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAr\u0131kan, 86 milyon vatanda\u015f\u0131n tamam\u0131n\u0131n kazanaca\u011f\u0131, adalet ve g\u00fcven duygusunun g\u00fc\u00e7lenece\u011fi bir T\u00fcrkiye hedeflediklerini belirterek, \u00f6n\u00fcm\u00fczdeki d\u00f6nemde farkl\u0131 siyasi akt\u00f6rlerle temaslar\u0131n ve ortak \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131n devam edece\u011fini s\u00f6yledi.\r\n\r\n","description":"Saadet Partisi Genel Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Ar\u0131kan, YRP Genel Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Fatih Erbakan\u2019\u0131 parti genel merkezinde kabul etti. G\u00f6r\u00fc\u015fmenin ard\u0131ndan konu\u015fan Ar\u0131kan, \u201cT\u00fcrkiye\u2019de\u2026","inLanguage":"tr-TR","keywords":[],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/milligazetecomtr.teimg.com\/crop\/1280x720\/milligazete-com-tr\/uploads\/2026\/08\/a-a-20260811-42190447-42190445-y-e-n-i-d-e-n-r-e-f-a-h-p-a-r-t-i-s-i-g-e-n-e-l-b-a-s-k-a-n-i-e-r-b-a-k-a-n-s-a-a-d-e-t-p-a-r-t-i-s-i-g-e-n-e-l-b-a-s-k-a-n-i-a-r-i-k-a-n-i-z-i-y-a-r-e-t-e-t-t-i.jpg","width":"1280","height":"720","caption":"Ar\u0131kan, Erbakan ile bir araya geldi... Ar\u0131kan: \"T\u00fcrkiye'nin \u00f6n\u00fcn\u00fc a\u00e7mak istiyoruz\" Erbakan: \"Milletimize umut olacak \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar yapaca\u011f\u0131z\""},"publishingPrinciples":"https:\/\/www.milligazete.com.tr\/yayin-ilkeleri","isFamilyFriendly":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","isAccessibleForFree":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.milligazete.com.tr\/#organization","name":"Milli Gazete","image":"https:\/\/milligazetecomtr.teimg.com\/milligazete-com-tr\/uploads\/2025\/11\/milli-gazete-dikey-1.svg","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/milligazetecomtr.teimg.com\/milligazete-com-tr\/uploads\/2025\/11\/milli-gazete-dikey-1.svg","width":"640","height":"375"}},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Abdullah Kutay Eskalen","url":"https:\/\/www.milligazete.com.tr\/muhabir\/72617\/abdullah-kutay-eskalen"},"editor":{"@type":"Person","name":"Zeynel Abidin B.","url":"https:\/\/www.milligazete.com.tr\/muhabir\/22179\/zeynel-abidin-b"},"creator":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.milligazete.com.tr\/#organization","name":"Milli Gazete","url":"https:\/\/www.milligazete.com.tr"}}</script>
